    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"darkness\" though. it's more like... everything is already gone. the people i loved, the places that mattered, the version of myself i actually liked. it's all just a hollow shell now. i'm just a ghost wandering through a cemetery of things that used to be alive. what am i supposed to \"work on\" when there's nothing left to build?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
